  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialText_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a92d78ffa075bab41a641bcab300661e, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 11093512192
    m_Localized: Greetings, Roller of Dice. I am <size=110%><color=#AC50CB>DEE YEM</color></size>,
      and I will be your guide in this arena.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 240794570752
    m_Localized: Harness the <size=110%><color=#FF0039>W</color></size>, <size=110%><color=#FF0039>A</color></size>,
      <size=110%><color=#FF0039>S</color></size> and <size=110%><color=#FF0039>D</color></size>
      keys to move about the area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 347543801856
    m_Localized: A true warrior knows when to make a daring approach as well as a
      tactical retreat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 452195880960
    m_Localized: Look alive! These foes mean you harm. Invoke the <size=110%><color=#FF0039>SPACE</color></size>
      key to use <size=110%><color=#FF0039>LIGHT ATTACKS</color></size> and dispatch
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 587197943808
    m_Localized: More adversaries alot more glory! <size=110%><color=#AC50CB>HOLD</color></size>
      the <size=110%><color=#FF0039>SPACE</color></size> key to channel your power
      into a <size=110%><color=#FF0039>HEAVY ATTACK</color></size>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 824327114752
    m_Localized: 'Roller of Dice, hear this: if you knock a foe into a wall with
      a <size=110%><color=#FF0039>HEAVY ATTACK</color></size> or otherwise they will
      be <color=#b8860b><size=110%>SLAMMED</size></color> against it and experience
      pain unmatched!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1351261720576
    m_Localized: 'Once a battle has concluded, you must claim a new <size=110%><color=#4a8fcc>SPELL</color></size>
      or restore your <size=110%><color=#179b48>VITALITY</color></size>. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1405875752960
    m_Localized: This tablet is a tool to manage your <size=110%><color=#AC50CB>MAGIC</color></size>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1527841918976
    m_Localized: Here you can assign new <size=110%><color=#4a8fcc>SPELLS</color></size>
      to your <size=110%><color=#AC50CB>DIE FACES</color></size>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1729004933120
    m_Localized: Store <size=110%><color=#4a8fcc>SPELLS</color></size> in your <size=110%><color=#AC50CB>INVENTORY</color></size>
      for later use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2017313001472
    m_Localized: Wield your <size=110%><color=#FF0039>MOUSE</color></size> to move
      this new <size=110%><color=#4a8fcc>SPELL</color></size> into one of your <size=110%><color=#4a8fcc>SPELL
      SLOTS</color></size>, and it will be harnessed by one of your <size=110%><color=#AC50CB>DIE
      FACES</color></size>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2346574254080
    m_Localized: Now, take the <size=110%><color=#4a8fcc>SPELL</color></size> in
      your inventory and <size=110%><color=#AC50CB>COMBINE</color></size> it with
      your new <size=110%><color=#4a8fcc>SPELL</color></size>. This will enhance
      the power of the <size=110%><color=#4a8fcc>SPELL</color></size> and unveil
      <size=110%><color=#AC50CB>NEW EFFECTS</color></size>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2523737460736
    m_Localized: You learn well! But take heed, as you can only combine <size=110%><color=#4a8fcc>SPELLS</color></size>
      of the same <size=110%><color=#AC50CB>TYPE</color></size> and <size=110%><color=#FFBB00>level</size></color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2822489346048
    m_Localized: Roller of Dice, you should now be prepared to take on the arena.
      <size=110%><color=#AC50CB>CONTINUE</color></size> when you're ready, I will
      remain to explain the effects of any <size=110%><color=#4a8fcc>SPELLS</color></size>
      you acquire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4818030137344
    m_Localized: In this instance, I demand you take this <size=110%><color=#4a8fcc>SPELL</color></size>,
      thus I can teach you about <size=110%><color=#AC50CB>MAGIC</color></size>!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5755012485120
    m_Localized: Listen close Roller, defeat this adversaries with <size=110%><color=#FF0039>HEAVY
      ATTACKS</color></size>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 390706157424640
    m_Localized: Choose wisely! This decision could determine your fate in the next
      bout...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
